OL,3,ATrump tells UN he has 'big decision' on
OL,4,Awhether to 'annihilate' Iran or make
OL,5,Apeace deal
OL,6,
OL,7,FPresident Donald Trump has told the
OL,8,FUnited Nations General Assembly he
OL,9,Ffaces a "big decision" on whether to
OL,10,Fstrike Iran again or pursue a peace
OL,11,Fdeal.
OL,13,FA single member of Iran's delegation
OL,14,Fwatched on during the president's
OL,15,Fspeech in New York, in which he said he
OL,16,Fcould "annihilate" the Islamic Republic
OL,17,Fif the conflict went unresolved.
