OL,3,ATrump tells UN he has 'big decision' on
OL,4,Awhether to 'annihilate' Iran or make
OL,5,Apeace deal
OL,6,
OL,7,FBefore a standing-room-only audience,
OL,8,FTrump also rejected "global
OL,9,Fgovernment", vowed to broker peace
OL,10,Fbetween Russia and Ukraine and ensure
OL,11,Fthe US wins the artificial intelligence
OL,12,Frace.
OL,14,FHis tone contrasted with remarks
OL,15,Fearlier by UN Secretary General Antonio
OL,16,FGuterres, who warned global divisions
OL,17,Fwere deepening and underscored the
OL,18,F"interdependence" of the world's
OL,19,Fpeoples.
